 "stimulus_html": "Use the figure to answer the following exercises. Identify the graph or graphs with the given characteristic.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/a975fc72f9add41c.png\" alt=\"Four graphs. Graph 1 has six vertices: a, b, c, d, e, and f. The edges connect a b, b c, b e, d e, and e f. Graph 2 has seven vertices: p, q, r, s, t, u, and v. The edges connect p q, q r, p s, q s, r t, q t, s u, and t v. Graph 3 has 8 vertices: g, h, i, j, k, o, m, and n. All the vertices are interconnected. Graph 4 has nine vertices: a, b, c, d, e, f, g, h, and i. The edges connect a b, b c, c f, a d, d g, g h, e h, e f, and e i.\">",
